OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal issued over man wanted on
OL,4,Aprison recall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man wanted by police should not be
OL,7,Fapproached and any sightings should be
OL,8,Freported straight away, a force had
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FAntonio Cruz, 50, from Blandford,
OL,12,FDorset, also has links to Dorchester
OL,13,Fand Weymouth and is wanted on prison
OL,14,Frecall, Dorset Police said.
OL,16,FDet Con Deborah Langford, who works for
OL,17,Fthe force, said: "We would urge anyone
OL,18,Fwho sees him to not approach and
OL,19,Finstead dial 999 immediately."
